# Derived output: regenerated by bootstrap.py, build_keycaps.py and
# place_caps.py, never committed. See "What is tracked and why" in README.md.
#
# The rule is one question: can this be regenerated headlessly? If yes it
# belongs here. If it needs a GUI FreeCAD session with the KiCadStepUp addon,
# it belongs in model/ and is tracked -- a checkout without those files cannot
# run most of the gate, and no amount of scripting will bring them back.
.build/

# Scratch workspace for the implementation process
.superpowers/

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# macOS Finder junk
.DS_Store

# FreeCAD locks, backups and recovery data; local to a checkout
*.FCStd1
*.FCBak
.FreeCAD-recovery*
